          "date": "2026-10-09 20:10:40.000000000",
          "tz": -300
        },
        "subject": "LU-20882 scripts: commit-msg avoids leaking temp files",
        "message": "LU-20882 scripts: commit-msg avoids leaking temp files\n\nRunning the commit-msg hook with --help created its temporary\nmessage file, named from an empty path, in the current\ndirectory and never removed it: a hidden .XXXXXX file with GNU\ncoreutils, a visible untracked file with uutils.\n\nCreate the temporary file only when there is a message to\ncheck, and quote the empty path that --help passes to\nbasename. Open the input before creating the temporary file\nso missing input does not leave a file behind either.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nFixes: b7ea3913f6fd (\"LU-930 misc: improve .mailmap coverage\")\nAssisted-by: Codex:gpt-6.1-sol\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I79cfc4c50615e071242ac1a629e99f8f07fa6ce5\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
